@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@batchId = replace-with-response-batch-id
@runId = replace-with-response-run-id

### 1. Confirm the API is available
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Reset the deterministic 120-case demo batch
POST {{baseUrl}}/demo/reset

### 3. Run both reconciliation stages
POST {{baseUrl}}/reconciliation-runs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "batchId": "{{batchId}}"
}

### 4. Inspect acceptance metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics?run_id={{runId}}

### 5. Inspect exceptions and persisted evidence
GET {{baseUrl}}/exceptions?run_id={{runId}}&status=open
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?batch_id={{batchId}}&page=1&page_size=25

### 6. Inspect outcome-focused audit events
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-events?batch_id={{batchId}}&page=1&page_size=50

### Optional: run the read-only Razorpay Test Mode adapter
POST {{baseUrl}}/razorpay/sync
